# results/

Materialized results land here, one file each, at the place ASTRA gives
it from its output's id and the `format:` its spec declares:

    results/<universe>/<output_id>.<format>

or `results/<output_id>.<format>` for an output built once. The record
of how each was made is at `.astra/records/`, at the same path with
`.json`.
